<ContentPage slug="msc-recharged" label="Recharged">
          <h2>Recharged — a native PC port of Mario Strikers Charged</h2>
          <figure class="setup-guide-media"><img class="setup-guide-logo" decoding="async" src="/assets/pc-ports/recharged-logo.webp" width="720" height="393" alt="Recharged logo"></figure>
          <p>Play Mario Strikers Charged natively on Windows, Linux, macOS and Steam Deck. Recharged compiles the reconstructed source code of the original Wii game into a real PC program. It is not an emulator: the game's own code runs unchanged, and Recharged supplies what the Wii hardware used to provide: graphics, sound, controllers, disc access and saves.</p>
          <h3>GitHub / Download</h3>
          <p><a class="cr-link cr-link-preserve-case" href="https://github.com/previouslevelgames/recharged" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/<wbr>previouslevelgames/recharged</a></p>
  </ContentPage>
